  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "While studying what Gu houses are so he can refine ownerless Water Pavilion, Fang Yuan traces their origin to the seven Lui Gui siblings of the olden antiquity era. They were demonic Gu Masters born as septuplets, experts in defence, and each reached rank five peak stage. Combining their strength, they used a defensive killer move called Turtle House. With it they defended against three attacks from a Gu Immortal, and history names that stand the three moves pact. Fang Yuan states that this Turtle House was the first Gu house in Gu Master history. On that basis, Gu houses are killer moves formed by combining and solidifying ten or more kinds of Gu worms.",
      "chapters": [
        568
      ],
